{
  "_comment": "Picker taps for lnx-server (1920x1080): tiles reroute the view. Tile list defaults to the live advertised set (renderers/picker.py live_views: every renderer showable with empty params, sorted, capped at 24 with alphabetically-last overflow dropped); tap_options carries no views list so a new view appears with no config edit. Tile rects are generated -- never hand-edit them; recompute with: python3 renderers/picker.py --width <W> --height <H> --views <csv> (paste under \"view_regions\" -> \"picker\": scoped entries precede global ones, so tiles win their screen space while the strips still serve elsewhere). Validate with `python3 touch.py --config touch.json --check-views` before restarting displayd-touch. Revert: restore the backup (see TOUCH.md).",
